  "aboutTitle": "About IqraSpace",
  "aboutTagline": "Read. Reflect. Connect.",
  "aboutIntro": "IqraSpace is a digital Quran space designed to make reading and connecting with the Quran simple, beautiful, and accessible.",
  "aboutMissionHeading": "Our Mission",
  "aboutMissionBody": "Our mission is to create a peaceful, easy-to-use Quran experience for everyone. We focus on simplicity, accessibility, thoughtful design, and features that support meaningful daily Quran reading.",
  "aboutVisionHeading": "Our Vision",
  "aboutVisionBody": "We envision IqraSpace as a trusted digital space for Quran engagement — bringing together reading, reflection, understanding, and meaningful learning experiences in the future.",
  "aboutValuesHeading": "Our Values",
  "aboutValueSimplicityTitle": "Simplicity",
  "aboutValueSimplicityDesc": "A clean, focused experience that keeps attention on the Quran.",
  "aboutValueAccessibilityTitle": "Accessibility",
  "aboutValueAccessibilityDesc": "A comfortable reading experience across devices and screen sizes.",
  "aboutValueRespectTitle": "Respect",
  "aboutValueRespectDesc": "Every feature and design decision is made with respect for the Quran and its importance.",
  "aboutValueContinuousTitle": "Continuous Improvement",
  "aboutValueContinuousDesc": "We continuously learn and improve to better serve our users.",
  "aboutAuthenticHeading": "Authentic Quranic Content",
  "aboutAuthenticBody1": "Accuracy and authenticity are our highest priorities. The Quranic text in IqraSpace is obtained from a trusted and authenticated Quran data source. We do not alter, rewrite, or modify the original Arabic Quranic text.",
  "aboutAuthenticBody2": "Fonts, display settings, bookmarks, translations, and other features are designed to enhance the reading experience while preserving the integrity of the Quranic text. Translations and supporting content are kept distinct from the original Arabic text.",
  "aboutBuiltForHeading": "Built for Quran Readers",
  "aboutBuiltForBody": "IqraSpace provides a focused Quran reading experience with customizable fonts, reading preferences, bookmarks, translations, and Tajweed support.",
  "aboutLookingAheadHeading": "Looking Ahead",
  "aboutLookingAheadBody": "Our current focus is building an excellent Quran Reader. In the future, we hope to introduce thoughtfully designed learning experiences while keeping the Quran at the heart of IqraSpace.",
